  <entry>
    <title>grpc/grpc - Releases - 2025-06-02</title>
    <id>https://github.com/grpc/grpc#2025-06-02</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc" />
    <updated>2025-06-03T00:07:37Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/releases/tag/v1.72.1"&gt;Release v1.72.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;This is release gRPC Core 1.72.1 (gusto).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For gRPC documentation, see &lt;a href="https://grpc.io/" rel="nofollow"&gt;grpc.io&lt;/a&gt;. For previous releases, see &lt;a href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/releases"&gt;Releases&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release contains refinements, improvements, and bug fixes, with highlights listed below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Python&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pin Cython to 3.1.1 &lt;a href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/39609" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/grpc/grpc/pull/39609/hovercard"&gt;#39609&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This solves several issues:
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3069416918" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/39588" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/grpc/grpc/issues/39588/hovercard" href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/39588"&gt;#39588&lt;/a&gt;: Selecting unstable Cython releases when building gRPC Python artifacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using inconsistent Cython version in released platform-specific wheels within the same grpcio release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3069295536" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/6878" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/cython/cython/issues/6878/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/6878"&gt;cython/cython#6878&lt;/a&gt; Several published grpcio wheels were built with Cython 3.1.0 and are affected by Cython memory leak issue when using AsyncIO APIs (&lt;code&gt;grpc.aio.*&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
